### Variables Globales
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@adminEmail = admin@sicba.edu
@password = password123

### ==========================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECK
### ==========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### ==========================================
### 2. AUTENTICACIÓN
### ==========================================

### 2.1 Login de Administrador
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Extraer Token
@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 2.2 Registro de Nuevo Usuario (Opcional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nuevo@sicba.edu",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "ALUMNO",
  "firstName": "Nuevo",
  "lastName": "Estudiante"
}


### ==========================================
### 3. PREGUNTAS (Protegidas)
### ==========================================

### 3.1 Obtener todas las preguntas
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.2 Crear nueva pregunta
POST {{baseUrl}}/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "¿Cuál es la integral de x^2?",
  "subjectId": "aqui-va-el-id-de-la-materia",
  "difficulty": "MEDIUM",
  "options": [
    { "content": "(x^3)/3 + C", "isCorrect": true },
    { "content": "2x", "isCorrect": false },
    { "content": "x^3 + C", "isCorrect": false }
  ]
}
